  "shared_key_variants": {
    "link.1be52ce4d6ee": "Reviewed Spanish opens the 'Comprehensive list at ... Going Further · References' line two ways: 01b-react and 01c-tools use 'Consulta la lista completa en', the other seven consumers use 'Lista completa en'. Both wordings shipped in the reviewed overlays; only the Spanish style PIC may reconcile them.",
    "text.140bedbf9c3f": "Reviewed Spanish localizes the reader-facing 01a-loop 'none' label as 'ninguna' while three protocol/status occurrences remain 'none'.",
    "text.552e423045fc": "Reviewed Spanish uses '(ninguno)' or '(ninguna)' for reader-facing empty states while operational and compact trace occurrences retain '(none)'.",
    "text.588da4105320": "Reviewed Spanish moves 'laberinto' into one 01a-loop separator value so the shared ternary keeps Spanish word order; the other separator occurrences remain punctuation only.",
    "text.67a5bdf2a82d": "Reviewed Spanish renders the 'NVIDIA · Securing Agents' brand line as 'Protección de agentes' on the course index and 'Seguridad de agentes' on the twelve lesson pages. Choosing one term is a Spanish terminology decision.",
    "text.680694f37af1": "Reviewed Spanish uses the full rendered-artifact hint on seven cells and the shorter 'Renderizado abajo' form on 02c-deep.",
    "text.898702fa218d": "Reviewed Spanish renders 'the Try-it artifact, in code' three ways: lowercase on 01a-loop, the shorter 'Código del artefacto' on 02a-routing and 02b-rag, and capitalized on the four remaining consumers.",
    "text.9fe101a0ec7e": "Reviewed Spanish renders 'OpenClaw gateway' as 'Gateway OpenClaw' on 03a-kickstart and 'gateway de OpenClaw' on 03b-openclaw.",
    "text.b2eef2ab0d7f": "Reviewed Spanish spells out ' mensajes' on 01a-loop and retains the compact trace abbreviation ' msgs' on 02c-deep.",
    "text.1f5087db919c": "Codex reviewed this distinction at the maintainer's request: 01b-react translates the learner-visible log label 'question' as 'pregunta'; 01c-tools and 02b-rag retain 'question' as an executable tool-schema field name."
  },
